*.tsbuildinfo

# Lambda build artifacts produced by `terraform plan/apply` (archive_file
# data sources unzip into infra/modules/<lambda>/.build/ on the host
# running terraform). The real artifacts are built fresh in CI; the local
# ones are noise.
infra/modules/*/.build/
